{%- comment -%}
  KUN-RC-COM-001B. TEMPLATE for Settings > Notifications > Order confirmation (and the Order status page
  "Additional content" if the store plan still offers it). Not applied. Owner authorization required.
  The link carries NO order number, e-mail or birth data: the buyer types the order number and the checkout
  e-mail on the claim page and receives a one-time code. Shown only when the order contains the Essentials SKU.
  English draft copy: needs ChatGPT English-content QA and owner approval before use.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign has_kundali = false -%}
{%- for line in line_items -%}
