{%- endfor -%}
{%- if has_kundali -%}
  <p><strong>Prepare your Janam Kundali Essentials</strong><br>
  Open <a href="https://REPLACE-commerce-staging-host/">the Kundali page</a>, enter order number
  {{ order_name }} and this e-mail address, and we will send you a one-time code. Your birth details are
  used only to prepare the PDF and are not stored. Please claim within 30 days of your order.</p>
{%- endif -%}
